  <main class="container" id="main-container">
    


    
  <div class="level is-marginless">
    <div class="level-left">
      <h1 class="title is-clearfix">
    
        Showing 1&ndash;50 of 1,449 results
    
</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="level-right is-hidden-mobile">
      <!-- feedback for mobile is moved to footer -->
      <span class="help" style="display: inline-block;"><a href="https://github.com/arXiv/arxiv-search/releases">Search v0.5.6 released 2020-02-24</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>
    </div>
  </div>
    <div class="content">
      
  
    

    <div class="columns">
      <div class="column is-two-thirds-tablet">
        <p style="margin-bottom: .5em">Query: <a href="/search/advanced?classification-computer_science=y&amp;classification-include_cross_list=include&amp;date-filter_by=date_range&amp;abstracts=show&amp;size=50&amp;start=0&amp;terms-0-operator=AND&amp;terms-0-term=agent&amp;terms-0-field=all&amp;terms-1-operator=OR&amp;terms-1-term=%22retrieval+augmented%22&amp;terms-1-field=all&amp;terms-2-operator=OR&amp;terms-2-term=%22language+model+evaluation%22&amp;terms-2-field=all&amp;date-from_date=2025-11-01&amp;date-to_date=2025-12-01&amp;date-date_type=announced_date_first&amp;order=-announced_date_first">order: -announced_date_first; size: 50; date_range: from 2025-11-01 to 2025-12-01; classification: Computer Science (cs); include_cross_list: True; terms: AND all=agent; OR all=&#34;retrieval augmented&#34;; OR all=&#34;language model evaluation&#34;</a></p>
        <div class="buttons">
          <a class="button is-link" href="/search/advanced?classification-computer_science=y&amp;classification-include_cross_list=include&amp;date-filter_by=date_range&amp;abstracts=show&amp;size=50&amp;start=0&amp;terms-0-operator=AND&amp;terms-0-term=agent&amp;terms-0-field=all&amp;terms-1-operator=OR&amp;terms-1-term=%22retrieval+augmented%22&amp;terms-1-field=all&amp;terms-2-operator=OR&amp;terms-2-term=%22language+model+evaluation%22&amp;terms-2-field=all&amp;date-from_date=2025-11-01&amp;date-to_date=2025-12-01&amp;date-date_type=announced_date_first&amp;order=-announced_date_first">Refine query</a><a class="button" href="/search/advanced">New search</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="column is-one-third-tablet is-hidden-mobile">
        <p class="has-text-right" style="margin-top: 1em">
          
          <a href="/search/?order=-announced_date_first&amp;size=50">Simple Search</a>
          
        </p>
      </div>
