    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        MCP vs RAG vs NLWeb vs HTML: A Comparison of the Effectiveness and Efficiency of Different <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agent</span> Interfaces to the Web (Technical Report)
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Steiner%2C+A">Aaron Steiner</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Peeters%2C+R">Ralph Peeters</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Bizer%2C+C">Christian Bizer</a>
      
